<h3>Docs — V2 Migration promoted to its own top-level project (#259 V2MIG)</h3>
<ul>
    <li><strong>DB:</strong> created project <code>V2MIG</code> (#259, top-level) + 5 phase sub-projects on the primary Ency (192.168.1.20:3307): V2MIG-P1 (#260) baseline/standards gate, V2MIG-P2 (#261) core/shared .tt, V2MIG-P3 (#262) feature .tt waves, <strong>V2MIG-P4 (#263) Planning page fixed IN LOCKSTEP with its v2 migration</strong> (root cause of the current planning-page rot), V2MIG-P5 (#264) sync &amp; verify (absorbs former AIMPS-P5 #257).</li>
