    <li><strong>MASTER_PLAN.tt:</strong> added a prominent V2 MIGRATION card (after GROUP 6), index rows for #259 (both .tt and .md), and a V2 MIG line in the glance pre. Noted AIMPS-P5 (#257) is now superseded by V2MIG-P5 (left in place, not deleted).</li>
